OL,3,GNEWSASenior nurse struck off for
OL,4,A'predatory' behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former head of nursing at a failing
OL,7,Fmental health hospital who inflicted
OL,8,F"predatory behaviour" on several female
OL,9,Fcolleagues has been struck off.
OL,11,FRennie Paul Bartlette was the head of
OL,12,Fnursing at Huntercombe Hospital in
OL,13,FMaidenhead between July 2021 and August
OL,14,F2022, when he was sacked for gross
OL,15,Fmisconduct.
OL,17,FBartlette was found to have made a
OL,18,Fcomment about a woman's breasts while
OL,19,Fhelping Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,20,Finspectors as they assessed a care home
OL,21,Fin May 2023.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
