OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nursing and Midwifery Council (NMC)
OL,7,Ffound he had deliberately withheld
OL,8,Fdetails of his dismissal from the CQC
OL,9,Fbefore it employed him as a nursing
OL,10,Fadvisor.
